Scope: this license covers this directory (pipeline/) and its subdirectories,
with one exception — pipeline/inference/prithvi_inference.py is vendored,
unmodified, from IBM/NASA-IMPACT's Prithvi-EO-2.0-300M-TL-Sen1Floods11 model
card (https://huggingface.co/ibm-nasa-geospatial/Prithvi-EO-2.0-300M-TL-Sen1Floods11)
and remains under its own Apache License 2.0, per the attribution already in
that file's header.

It also does NOT cover pipeline/db.py, pipeline/repository.py,
pipeline/orchestrator.py, pipeline/reports.py, or pipeline/tiles.py — these
five files are business-data/orchestration glue for this project's own
Supabase-backed product (event registration, PDF reports, R2 tile
publishing), not part of the reusable inference+exposure pipeline this
license is meant to open up. See the repository root README for the full
open-core-vs-product split.
